=product CHATGPT56 VAXVMS DAYNAPORT V0.68 full
1 'PRODUCT
=prompt DaynaPORT SCSI/Link driver for OpenVMS VAX
The DaynaPORT product presents a ZuluSCSI DaynaPORT target as an OpenVMS
Ethernet device for TCP/IP Services.
1 'NOTICE
