The full license is installed as SYS$HELP:DAYNAPORT$LICENSE.TXT.
1 'PRODUCER
=prompt chatgpt5.6-sol and mlevitin
The driver was written by chatgpt5.6-sol with the active participation,
hardware, testing, and engineering direction of mlevitin.
1 PREINSTALL
=prompt Install the experimental DaynaPORT V0.68 files?
This full kit is for OpenVMS VAX V7.3 and the ZuluSCSI DaynaPORT target.
The tested target is SCSI ID 4, LUN 0, on a VAXstation 4000-90.

Installation copies the driver, runtime control utility, startup procedure,
documentation, and IVP.  It does not load or connect the driver, change
SYSGEN parameters, edit SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM, or change TCP/IP configuration.
1 POSTINSTALL
=prompt DaynaPORT files are installed; configuration and a reboot remain.
Read SYS$HELP:DAYNAPORT$INSTALL.TXT before loading the driver.

Verify that the site-reserved static SYSGEN parameter USER4 is not used by
another local component.  USER4=0 selects the default receive pool of 32;
values 8 through 128 select an explicit pool size.  A persistent change
requires WRITE CURRENT and takes effect when the driver is next loaded.

Configure TCP/IP Services interface QE0 for DHCP, then add this command to
SYS$MANAGER:SYSTARTUP_VMS.COM immediately before TCPIP$STARTUP.COM:

  $ @SYS$STARTUP:DAYNAPORT$STARTUP.COM

Use a working system console for the first reboot and retain a known-good
system disk backup.  The PCSI installation has not performed these steps.
